hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27678","Haddathana Waki', he said: Umm Ghurab narrated to me from a woman called Aqilah, from Salamah bint al-Hurr, she said: I heard the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, saying: There shall come upon the people a time when they stand an hour finding no imam to pray with them."
"27679","Haddathana Isma'il ibn Muhammad, he said: Haddathana Marwan, he said: A woman called Talhah, freedwoman of Banu Fazarah, narrated to us from a freedwoman of theirs called Aqilah, from Salamah bint al-Hurr, she said: I heard the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, saying: Among the signs of the Hour, or among the worst of creation, is that the people of the mosque push one another, finding no imam to pray with them."
